```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Src as Video Source
    participant S3 as S3 Bucket
    participant MC as MediaConvert
    participant Rek as Rekognition
    participant DB as DynamoDB

    Src->>S3: Upload video
    S3->>MC: Trigger transcoding
    MC->>S3: Store frames
    S3->>Rek: Analyze frames
    Rek->>DB: Store detections
    DB-->>Src: Return results
```
